;---------------------------------------------------
;
; coding information
;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
;
C00,Central Electronics (J519) Coding
C01,?xxxx: Chassis
C02,0 - Limousine (PR-K8B)
C03,1 - Avant (PR-K8D)
C04,x?xxx: Driving Light Switch
C05,0 - without Rain/Light Sensor (G397 / PR-8K0/8K1/9C6/8K4)
C06,1 - with Rain/Light Sensor (G397 / PR-8K3/8K7/9C7/8K9)
C07,xx?xx: Trailer Hitch
C08,0 - without Trailer Hitch (PR-1D0)
C09,1 - with Trailer Hitch (PR-1D2)
C10,xxx?x: Headlights
C11,0 - Halogen Headlights w/o Daytime Running Lights (PR-8Q0/8Q1+8K0/8K7)
C12,1 - Halogen Headlights with Daytime Running Lights (PR-8Q0/8Q1+8K1/8K3/9C6/9C7)
C13,2 - Bi-Xenon Headlights with Daytime Running Lights (PR-8Q3/8Q5+8K9/8K4)
C14,3 - Bi-Xenon Headlights w/o Daytime Running Lights (PR-8Q3/8Q5+8K0/8K7)
C15,4 - Bi-Xenon Headlights with Daytime Running/Tail/License Plate Lights (PR-8Q3/8Q5+8K1/8K3)
C16,xxxx?: Country
C17,1 - Rest of World/Nordic Countries/Denmark/Croatia/Baltic Countries with Bi-Xenon
C18,2 - Nordic Countries/Denmark/Croatia/Baltic Countries without Bi-Xenon
C19,3 - USA/Canada with Bi-Xenon / 4 - Canada without Bi-Xenon
C20,5 - Special Vehicles
;
